  "description": "As a successful courtesan, Hwayoung believes she’s seen every kind of man the world has to offer. That is, until a nameless new servant arrives at the house. Hwayoung can’t help her curiosity about him, and her flirtations seem to turn him into putty in her hands. But pretty soon, Hwayoung will be the one unable to resist the seductions of this not-so-innocent beast. Just who is the one getting tamed here?!\n\nSource: Tapas",
